OL,3,GNEWSAQueue-busting traffic lights added
OL,4,Ato roundabout
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew traffic lights that detect queues
OL,7,Fand help reduce congestion have been
OL,8,Fswitched on for the first time.
OL,10,FThe signals at Bumpers Farm roundabout
OL,11,Fin Chippenham, Wiltshire, are part of a
OL,12,F#31.9m traffic scheme.
OL,14,FThe lights are part of the A350
OL,15,FChippenham Bypass improvement scheme
OL,16,Fled by Wiltshire Council to upgrade the
OL,17,Fremaining single-carriageway sections
OL,18,Fof the bypass into a full dual
OL,19,Fcarriageway.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
