OL,3,GNEWSAQueue-busting traffic lights added
OL,4,Ato roundabout
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council says there will be a
OL,7,F"settling-in period" while the new
OL,8,Ftraffic lights at Bumpers roundabout
OL,9,Fare monitored and timings adjusted, and
OL,10,Fpeople have been asked to "bear with us
OL,11,Fwhile that work takes place."
